<title>UK: Bunzl expands plastic caps and plugs business.</title>
<headline>Bunzl expands plastic caps and plugs business.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>International paper and plastics group Bunzl Plc said on Wednesday it had acquired California- based Thinking Plastics Inc and its associated company MDX Plastics Inc for up to $4.3 million.</p>
<p>The final price may be adjusted downwards according to the value of net assets acquired on completion.</p>
<p>The U.S. companies manufacture a range of proprietary industrial plastic parts particularly for the U.S. tubular furniture and equipment market.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
